pro_course_detail.description:
It's not what you say, it's how you say it!

Most English classes teach words and grammar, but that isn't enough.  In this 10-lesson course you will master all the sounds of English and then add some SPICE:  

Stress:  The way we say certain sounds and words with emphasis, to make our meaning clear;
Pacing:  Speaking at the right speed, with pauses, to help listeners process our speech;
Intonation:  The way our speech rises and falls to change our meaning;
Connected speech:  Linking, elision, assimilation and rhythm;
Emotion:  Say it like you mean it!

I will coach you to use these skills with ALL the different kinds of English you need, eg: work and business meetings; academic tests, speeches and presentations; acting, singing, traveling, socialising, and so on.

These skills are needed by learners at all levels from beginner to proficient, but a basic level of A2 is recommended so that you have plenty of language to work with.

I recommend 10 hours (10 x 60-minute) lessons to learn all the essential pronunciation skills you need, with time to practice and perfect these skills with expert one-to-one coaching.

I also provide all the self-study practice material you need, for free, and give you full access to the unique tools I have designed.

Transform your English and take your language skills to a whole new level, gaining the confidence to speak in any situation, with absolutely anyone!

*As I am new to the ITALKI platform, for a limited time I am offering this course at a cheaper price than I would usually charge.
